    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BikeVR is a realistic motorcycle riding simulator built specifically for Virtual Reality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ride with your hands:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875790/extras/49a2a77edde9bb9d5186e239e7e333b0.poster.avif?t=1746895665\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875790/extras/49a2a77edde9bb9d5186e239e7e333b0.webm?t=1746895665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875790/extras/49a2a77edde9bb9d5186e239e7e333b0.mp4?t=1746895665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can control a bike with your VR controllers as if you were holding the handlebars of a real motorcycle.  <br>The game provides realistic motorbike physics and handling together with riding excitement while taking into account the known limitations of VR controllers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Squeeze through a busy highway:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875790/extras/8e09e20847dbf4c6637b55accc0d5bf9.poster.avif?t=1746895665\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875790/extras/8e09e20847dbf4c6637b55accc0d5bf9.webm?t=1746895665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875790/extras/8e09e20847dbf4c6637b55accc0d5bf9.mp4?t=1746895665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong> Split lanes, do wheelies, lean knee down, but don't crash or get caught:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875790/extras/9f5c555bee98fdab0a6b141cf2ad44cf.poster.avif?t=1746895665\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875790/extras/9f5c555bee98fdab0a6b141cf2ad44cf.webm?t=1746895665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875790/extras/9f5c555bee98fdab0a6b141cf2ad44cf.mp4?t=1746895665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875790/extras/3f337d97fa8be43285e0e139d0fbd863.poster.avif?t=1746895665\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875790/extras/3f337d97fa8be43285e0e139d0fbd863.webm?t=1746895665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875790/extras/3f337d97fa8be43285e0e139d0fbd863.mp4?t=1746895665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
